  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco de Credito Centroamericano II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a senior loan of up to US$4,000,000 and a subordinated loan of up to US$2,000,000 to Banco de Cr&#xE9;dito Centroamericano-Bancentro. The senior loan will have a term of up to 7 years, including a grace period of up to 2 years. The subordinated loan will have a term of up to 7 years, including a grace period of up to 63 months. The funds of the senior loan will be used to provide medium and long-term financing to small and medium-size Nicaraguan companies operating in productive sectors of the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a senior loan of up to US$4,000,000 and a subordinated loan of up to US$2,000,000 to Banco de Cr&#xE9;dito Centroamericano-Bancentro. The senior loan will have a term of up to 7 years, including a grace period of up to 2 years. The subordinated loan will have a term of up to 7 years, including a grace period of up to 63 months. The funds of the senior loan will be used to provide medium and long-term financing to small and medium-size Nicaraguan companies operating in productive sectors of the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
